From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] editor: include the QMenu definition

Qt's QScintilla header only forward-declares QMenu. GCC 14 therefore rejects
the calls to addAction() and addSeparator() in toSqlText because their receiver
is incomplete. Include QMenu where those methods are used.

Patch-Source: downstream adaptation of tora 3.2 src/editor/tosqltext.cpp
Patch-License: GPL-2.0-only
Upstream-Status: Not Submitted (automated upstream writes forbidden)
Applies-To: tora 3.2
Remove-When: upstream tosqltext.cpp includes QMenu before using its methods
---
 src/editor/tosqltext.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/editor/tosqltext.cpp b/src/editor/tosqltext.cpp
--- a/src/editor/tosqltext.cpp
+++ b/src/editor/tosqltext.cpp
@@ -47,6 +47,7 @@
 #endif
 
 #include <QListWidget>
+#include <QMenu>
 #include <QVBoxLayout>
 #include <QApplication>
 
-- 
2.50.1
